# text = As regards its interior , it was dusty ; it was blocked up with high-backed ugly pews ; the gallery in which the children sat at the end of the church , and in which two ancient musicians blew their bassoons , was all awry , and looked as though it would fall ; the pulpit was an ugly useless edifice , as high nearly as the roof would allow , and the reading-desk under it hardly permitted the parson to keep his head free from the dangling tassels of the cushion above him .
