# text = But the moonlight still pierced brightly through the little avenue , and she , as she looked up to him , could see the form of his face and the loving softness of his eye said he ; and then he stooped over her and pressed her closely , while she put up her lips to his , standing on tip-toe that she might reach to his face she said As Crosbie walked back to the Great House that night , he made a firm resolution that no consideration of worldly welfare should ever induce him to break his engagement with Lily Dale .
