# text = He was never so happy as when surrounded by butchers ; graziers , and salesmen who were able to appreciate the work of his life , and who regarded him as a model nobleman he said to Eames , pointing to the prize bullock , Eames had joined his patron at the show after his office hours , looking on upon the living beef by gaslight said Johnny , who had not as yet been able to learn much about the Guestwick stock said Johnny , who looked very hard , but could not see exclaimed the earl said Johnny said the earl , angrily
