# text = It might be a very fine thing to be asked to dinner with an earl ; and John Eames had perhaps received at his office some little accession of dignity from the circumstance , of which he had been not unpleasantly aware ; but , as he sat at the table , on which there were four or five apples and a plate of dried nuts , looking at the earl , as he endeavoured to keep his eyes open , and at the colonel , to whom it seemed absolutely a matter of indifference whether his companions were asleep or awake , he confessed to himself that the price he was paying was almost too dear .
