# text = Then the whole affair was told as to the black eye , the police , and the superintendent asked our hero But Eames was not so widely awake to the importance of his friend's adventures as he might have been had he not been weighted with adventures of his own said he said Cradell with the air of a man who from experience was well up in such matters said Eames I should write down to a man I know in the country , and ask his advice , said Eames said Eames , with a touch of scorn in his voice After that , Cradell managed to carry back the conversation to Mrs Lupex and his own peculiar position , and as Eames did not care to ask from his companion further advice in his own matters , he listened nearly in silence till they reached Burton Crescent said Mrs Roper to him , as soon as they were all seated at dinner said Johnny .
