# text = He did pick it up , and once more flung away his head over the back of it , and stretched his finger-nails almost down to the carpet said Mrs Roper to her son , who was now in the room said Miss Spruce , preparing to leave the room said Lupex , raising himself again from his chair , not perhaps altogether disposed to remain upstairs while the dinner , for which it was intended that he should some day pay , was being eaten below said Miss Spruce exclaimed Lupex ; and hurrying forward he seized Miss Spruce by the hand But the special privileges which Mr Lupex would have accorded to age were never made known to the inhabitants of Mrs Roper's boarding-house , for the door of the room was again opened at this moment , and Mr Cradell entered said Eames .
