# text = Lupex turned from one to the other as they thus defended the man whom he suspected , and shook his head at each assertion that was made he asked Mr Lupex , as he made this speech , was walking about the room , and as he finished it he threw his pocket-handkerchief with violence on to the floor he said Then he picked up his handkerchief and walked down into the dining-room said Eames to his friend , having run upstairs for the purpose of saying a word to him while he washed his hands said Cradell , who rather liked this view of the matter Eames , as he had no answer ready to this counter attack , left the room and went downstairs .
