# text = Eames got up to take the shawl , and Mrs Lupex went on said Mrs Roper Mrs Roper , as she went to bed that night , made up her mind that , whatever might be the cost and trouble of doing so , she would lose no further time in getting rid of her married guests Lily Dale's constitution was good , and her recovery was retarded by no relapse or lingering debility ; but , nevertheless , she was forced to keep her bed for many days after the fever had left her .
