# text = He shuffled in , and coming direct up to John's desk , flopped his ledger down upon it before its owner had had time to close the drawer which contained the precious letter said Mr Kissing , feeling strongly convinced there was a novel hidden there , but not daring to express his belief A bystander listening to Mr Kissing's tone would have been led to believe that the whole Income-tax Office was jeopardised by the terrible iniquity thus disclosed pleaded Johnny said Eames Mr Kissing looked at Mr Love ; and Mr Love looked steadfastly at his desk continued Johnny said Mr Love , who rather liked John Eames , and hated Mr Kissing with his whole heart began Mr Kissing , still pointing with a finger of bitter reproach to the misused S , and beginning an oration which was intended for the benefit of the whole room , and for the annihilation of old Mr Love
