# text = There was a smile upon Lily's face as she lifted up her finger as if in caution , and no one looking at her would have supposed that she was herself in trouble she said , pointing to the drawing-room door , and speaking almost in a whisper and Mrs Dale went into the parlour as she was bidden she repeated said Lily , putting her hand inside her mother's arm said the mother , suddenly remembering that the use of the old proverb at the present moment had been almost cruel said Lily Then Mrs Dale did open the door , giving some little premonitory notice with the handle , so that the couple inside might be warned of approaching footsteps .
