# text = As he came to a definite conclusion on this subject the little handbell which always stood on Sir Raffle's table was sounded , and Eames was called into the presence of the great man said Sir Raffle , leaning back in his arm-chair , and stretching himself after the great exertions which he had been making Eames was always angered when his new patron Sir Raffle talked of his old friendship with the earl , and never gave the Commissioner any encouragement said he Whereupon Johnny rang the bell -- not the little handbell , but the other bell continued Sir Raffle said Eames , determined that he would not even sully his lips with speaking of Sir Raffle's boots asked Eames Then Eames withdrew , so that he might not be present at the interview between Sir Raffle and his boots said Sir Raffle to himself Soon after the little episode of the boots Eames left his office , and walked home alone to Burton Crescent .
