# text = Hopkins , equal to the occasion , shook his head as he trotted on , deposited his load at the foot of the cucumber-frames , and then at once returning to his master , tendered to him the key of the greenhouse said Hopkins , speaking as best he could with his scanty breath Now as Hopkins was well known by the squire to be the owner of three or four hundred pounds , the hint about the workhouse must be allowed to have been melodramatic said the squire , almost gnashing his teeth said Hopkins
